{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.MarkovTraceInstance","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeProductInjective","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeight","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedPartitionShape","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.NumSYTPos","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.WenzlSchurElementBridge"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.exists_nonzero_wtrace_orthogonal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.exists_nonzero_wtrace_orthogonal","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.lean#L85-L136","doc":"**The Ocneanu trace form on `H_3(q)` is degenerate.**\n\nThere is a nonzero `x ∈ Hecke ℝ q q⁻¹ 2` with `wtrace (x * b) = 0` for *every*\n`b` — so the form `⟨x, b⟩ = wtrace (x * b)` has nonzero radical and `wtrace` is\nnot faithful.\n\n`x` is the Wedderburn preimage of the tuple that is the identity on the\nthree-row block and zero on the other two.  Nonzero because `heckeProduct` is\ninjective; invisible because the three-row weight is zero and every other block\nkills it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.ocneanuWeight_colThree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.ocneanuWeight_colThree","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.lean#L77-L81","doc":"**The weight vanishes on the column shape.**  This is the invariant the\nscope-(b) exclusion rests on. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.colThree_rowLen_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.colThree_rowLen_two","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.lean#L73-L75","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.colThree_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.colThree_card","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.colThree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.colThree","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuTraceNotFaithful.lean#L67-L69","doc":"The column shape `(1,1,1)` — three cells in three rows, the smallest shape\nwhose Ocneanu weight vanishes at convention `D`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}